  "description": {
    "text": "Trainer Deck B, also called Misty's Deck, is a 60-card Water deck that Wizards of the Coast made in 1999 for the Pokémon League's Cerulean City season, the companion of Trainer Deck A. It was never sold; its box calls such decks tools for the Gym Leader. Collectors have found sealed copies of Trainer Deck B more often than of A, and how many ever reached the Leagues is unclear.\n\nThe cards are early Base Set printings with a red border and \"Trainer Deck B\" in red on the back. Their fronts match Base Set, except that the Blastoise is non-holo, the only non-holo Base Set Blastoise Wizards of the Coast printed.",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "Bulbapedia: Trainer Deck B (TCG) (Wayback Machine copy, 28 August 2026)",
        "url": "https://web.archive.org/web/20260828205615/https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Trainer_Deck_B_(TCG)"
      },
      {
        "title": "Elite Fourum: Brock's Trainer Deck A and Misty's Trainer Deck B",
        "url": "https://www.elitefourum.com/t/brocks-trainer-deck-a-and-mistys-trainer-deck-b/13103"
      }
    ]
  },
  "tell": {
    "text": "A red-bordered back reading \"Trainer Deck B\"",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "Elite Fourum: Brock's Trainer Deck A and Misty's Trainer Deck B",
        "url": "https://www.elitefourum.com/t/brocks-trainer-deck-a-and-mistys-trainer-deck-b/13103"
      },
      {
